<h2>International draughts endgame database downloads</h2>
<p>You can download install files for the Kingsrow 8-piece WLD and MTC endgame
databases using the links below. To use the 8-piece database, you also need to
install the database of 2 through 7 pieces. The files are hosted at Mega. For
downloading these large files, Mega only supports Chrome and Opera web browsers.
<a href="http://edgilbert.org/Checkers/Mega.htm">More about downloading from
Mega.</a></p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://mega.co.nz/#F!vRhFgSjR!bqlaniDcxC65fZWpnovROA">WLD database
    2 through 7 pieces</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://mega.co.nz/#F!fYomWJCK!bK1E3PUAmQrdRann74hibA">WLD 8-piece database, part 1 of 2</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://mega.co.nz/#F!TA5UQazI!MT1sVdqswfUQEeAUP1OPXw">WLD 8-piece database, part 2 of 2</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://mega.nz/#F!zFYGVabL!ZHgOq46KQ_XL8d7z_Zm_PQ">MTC database
    2 through 8 pieces</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Each install contains a group of .bin files and an .exe setup program file.
Download all the files to your PC, then run the setup program to install the
database on your hard drive.</p>
<hr>
<h5><a href="mailto:eygilbert@gmail.com">Ed Gilbert</a><br>
